      "value": "@{618ece8f22b63e309408b761|full_name} Having a handy object just there readily available to users, over having to nab a niche prefab/avatar raises the accessibility of a tool like this. It also can showcase the usability of items as tools alongside gimmicks, over just being a silly subset of niche gimmicks.",
