  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "I understand that it is trying to be a reference to... well the common Portal easter egg, however the old version did serve some nice purposes that could be used in world debugging / examining other worlds. I would suggest providing a global alternative to the cube to maintain the bit, over returning the old style. Having an object that is 1 meter tall (maybe add measurement lines) and supports niche world features such as Audio Link would be useful for World Creators to use IN REFERENCE on other published worlds.",
